# Screenshot-audit output. These are rendered from the LIVE database, so they
# contain real portfolio names, holdings and balances. A previous set of these
# was committed to this public repo and had to be purged from history — never
# track them. Run the audit against seeded demo data if output must be shared.
client/button-audit-screenshots/

# Playwright output if the runner is invoked from the repo root
# rather than from client/ (client/test-results/ is covered above).
test-results/
